# Milestone Execution: Sync & Seal

When a milestone’s **implementation is finished** (or the user asks to wrap up), produce **all** of the following. Do not skip any item on initial wrap-up.

**Follow-up tweaks after wrap-up:** update only what changed—usually the **current** milestone test script and completion report (small sections or a short “Follow-up” note). Do **not** reload or rewrite historical milestone docs unless the user requests a full refresh.

## Required Outputs (Checklist)

### 1. Verification Test Script
**Path:** `milestone_tests/milestone-{N}-{kebab-case-name}.js`

Requirements:
- Import `checkServerHealth` from `./utils/test-helpers`
- Call health check first; abort with clear message if server is down
- Cover all major features built in this milestone
- Include both success and failure/error scenarios
- Use `✅`/`❌` output indicators
- Print a final summary block at the end

```javascript
const { checkServerHealth } = require('./utils/test-helpers');
const BASE_URL = 'http://localhost:4000/api';

async function testMilestone{N}() {
  console.log('=== MILESTONE {N} VERIFICATION TEST ===\n');
  const healthCheck = await checkServerHealth(BASE_URL);
  if (!healthCheck.success) {
    console.log('\n❌ Cannot proceed: Server is not running');
    return;
  }
  // ... tests ...
  console.log('\n=== TEST SUMMARY ===');
}
testMilestone{N}().catch(console.error);
```

---

### 2. Completion Report
**Path:** `milestone_reports/MILESTONE-{N}-COMPLETION-REPORT.md`

Required sections:
- Header: milestone number, date, project name, status
- Requirements checklist with ✅ for each deliverable
- Implementation summary with actual file paths
- Verification test results
- Code quality notes and security considerations
- Readiness checklist for next milestone
- Next steps preview

---

### 3. Update milestone_tests/README.md
Add a new entry under "Current Tests" with:
- Milestone number and name
- File path
- List of test scenarios covered

---

### 4. Update milestone_reports/README.md
Add a new entry under "Current Reports" with:
- Milestone number, name, file path, status, date
- Bullet list of deliverables

---

### 5. Update PROJECT-ORGANIZATION.md
Only if this milestone added new files, folders, or changed the directory structure.

---

### 6. Update Root package.json
Add test script entry:
```json
"test:milestone-{N}": "node milestone_tests/milestone-{N}-{kebab-case}.js"
```

---

### 7. Update server/docs/swagger.json
Required if any API endpoints were added or modified in this milestone.
Verify the docs render correctly at `http://localhost:4000/api-docs`.

---

## After All Outputs Are Generated

- Run the verification test and confirm it passes.
- Commit with this message format:

```
feat(milestone-{N}): complete {milestone-name}

- Add Milestone {N} completion report and verification test
- Document {key-feature-1}, {key-feature-2}, {key-feature-3}
- Update project documentation and test scripts

All {N} milestones now documented and verified.
```

## Naming Quick Reference

| Artifact | Format |
|----------|--------|
| Test script | `milestone-{number}-{kebab-case-description}.js` |
| Completion report | `MILESTONE-{NUMBER}-COMPLETION-REPORT.md` |
| npm test script key | `test:milestone-{number}` |
